  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1805.03 Retention of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1805.03 Retention of Records.\n\n(a) Upon request by the department, the asbestos abatement entity and owner or operator shall submit the records described in Env-A 1805.02 to the department within 3 business days.\n\n(b) Except as provided in (c), below, the asbestos abatement entity and owner or operator shall not destroy records unless they are more than 30 years old, dated from the completion of the asbestos abatement.\n\n(c) For an asbestos abatement at a school, the owner or operator shall maintain records for 3 years after each triennial inspection.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
